# 315 - rmail Login Flush Hook

ALE hook that triggers queue flushing for all rmail services when a player logs in.
Ensures queued messages attempt delivery when recipients come online.

## Current Behavior

rmail services (mail, narrator) queue messages for offline recipients. Messages
stay in the queue until:
- `on_send` hook fires (after successful delivery of another message)
- Manual intervention

If a recipient comes online but no messages are being actively sent, their
queued messages sit indefinitely.

## Intended Behavior

When any player logs into the game server:
1. ALE detects the login event
2. ALE runs a master flush script
3. The script triggers flush for each rmail service
4. Each service writes one pending message per subscriber to its outbox
5. rmail attempts delivery, which triggers `on_send` chains

This "primes the pump" for queued message delivery.

## Implementation

### ALE: Master Login Hook

```lua
-- {{{ src/lua/rmail-flush.lua
-- Master flush hook - runs on player login
-- Triggers all rmail service flush scripts

local DIR = "/mnt/mtwo/games/azeroth-core/wow-chat-2026"

local FLUSH_SCRIPTS = {
    DIR .. "/game-mail/mail/scripts/mail-onlogin.lua",
    DIR .. "/game-mail/narrator/scripts/narrator-onlogin.lua",
    -- Add more services as needed
}

-- {{{ OnPlayerLogin
local function OnPlayerLogin(event, player)
    -- Run all flush scripts in background
    for _, script in ipairs(FLUSH_SCRIPTS) do
        os.execute("lua " .. script .. " &")
    end
end
-- }}}

RegisterPlayerEvent(PLAYER_EVENT_ON_LOGIN, OnPlayerLogin)
-- }}}
```

### Alternative: Single Flush Script

Instead of multiple scripts, one script that handles all services:

```lua
#!/usr/bin/env lua
-- {{{ rmail-flush-all.lua
-- Flush all rmail service queues

local DIR = "/mnt/mtwo/games/azeroth-core/wow-chat-2026"

-- {{{ Service definitions
local services = {
    {
        name = "mail",
        pending_file = DIR .. "/game-mail/mail/.pending-forwards.txt",
        outbox_path = DIR .. "/game-mail/mail/outbox/",
        format_message = formatMailMessage,
    },
    {
        name = "narrator",
        pending_file = DIR .. "/game-mail/narrator/.pending-speech.txt",
        outbox_path = DIR .. "/game-mail/narrator/outbox/",
        format_message = formatSpeechMessage,
    },
}
-- }}}

-- {{{ flushService
function flushService(service)
    local pending = readPendingFile(service.pending_file)
    local attempted = {}

    for _, entry in ipairs(pending) do
        local subscriber = entry.subscriber or entry[2]  -- handle different formats

        if not attempted[subscriber] then
            local message = service.format_message(entry)
            writeToOutbox(service.outbox_path, subscriber, message)
            attempted[subscriber] = true
        end
    end

    return countKeys(attempted)
end
-- }}}

-- {{{ main
for _, service in ipairs(services) do
    local count = flushService(service)
    if count > 0 then
        log(string.format("Flushed %d subscribers for %s", count, service.name))
    end
end
-- }}}
-- }}}
```

